sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Person
    participant B as Authy
    participant H as Holders
    participant Q as Quorum
    participant K as New key
    U->>B: lost the device
    B-->>U: start recovery
    B->>H: ask 3 of 5 vouchers
    H-->>Q: sign the request
    alt quorum not reached
      Q-->>U: wait and retry
    else 3 signatures
      Q->>K: mint a new root
    end
    K->>B: bind the same identity
    B->>B: carry standing forward
    B->>H: revoke old keys
    H-->>U: report the change
    Note over B,K: keys rotate · identity stays
    U->>B: unlock the new device
